§§ `1. Kind of fund`

-- Marketing prose: the portfolio is offered with the "MAXX Phúc Lộc Thịnh Vượng" product;
-- research is said to show asset allocation drives over 90% of results; the portfolio is
-- the three funds. Inert. This is the only place the product's name appears in the text.
